{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.avif?t=1766849971\" alt=\"Horizontal image of Peace never lasts past sunset in English\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras_big/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.webp?t=1766849971 width=1560 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PENANCE is a psychological survival horror shooter experience with a strong narrative focus. You wake up in a place that feels familiar, yet wrong. A quiet street. An empty house. A note from Sienna, your wife. And when the sun sets, something begins to hunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Calen, a man trapped between memory and nightmare. Your only goal: survive the night and find Sienna. Each path pulls you deeper into a shifting world of deserted neighborhoods, looming towers, forgotten villages, and cities swallowed by ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.poster.avif?t=1766849971\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.webm?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.mp4?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stealth, Action, and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological survival horror, survival is never guaranteed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong>: Infiltrate enemy strongholds, evade patrols, and move silently through the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong>: Engage in tense action sequences, fight or shoot when escape is no longer an option, and scavenge<strong>\u00a0</strong>for scarce supplies to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental and narrative-driven challenges to unlock new paths and uncover the truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter demands a decision: when to fight, when to hide, and when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.poster.avif?t=1766849971\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.webm?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.mp4?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight offers a fragile peace, giving you time to prepare. But when night falls, the air thickens and the hunt begins. Creatures emerge from the shadows, and survival becomes a fight against both the unknown and the horrors of the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.poster.avif?t=1766849971\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.webm?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.mp4?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969640?t=1766849971","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/62c4e5e595b624f5704dce8d8a7019d3ca152838/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766849971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/a3da3624471bb8718037916019bf476cce5090f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766849971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/a3da3624471bb8718037916019bf476cce5090f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766849971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains graphic violence, gore, and disturbing imagery. Players will use firearms and other weapons to fight against hostile creatures and human soldiers, resulting in blood. The horror themes include psychological tension, unsettling environments, and frightening encounters that may not be suitable for all audiences.\r\n\r\nThe game does not include sexual content, sexual assault, or non-consensual acts. There are no depictions of drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.avif?t=1766849971\" alt=\"Horizontal image of Peace never lasts past sunset in English\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras_big/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.webp?t=1766849971 width=1560 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PENANCE is a psychological survival horror shooter experience with a strong narrative focus. You wake up in a place that feels familiar, yet wrong. A quiet street. An empty house. A note from Sienna, your wife. And when the sun sets, something begins to hunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Calen, a man trapped between memory and nightmare. Your only goal: survive the night and find Sienna. Each path pulls you deeper into a shifting world of deserted neighborhoods, looming towers, forgotten villages, and cities swallowed by ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.poster.avif?t=1766849971\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.webm?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.mp4?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stealth, Action, and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological survival horror, survival is never guaranteed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong>: Infiltrate enemy strongholds, evade patrols, and move silently through the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong>: Engage in tense action sequences, fight or shoot when escape is no longer an option, and scavenge<strong>\u00a0</strong>for scarce supplies to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental and narrative-driven challenges to unlock new paths and uncover the truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter demands a decision: when to fight, when to hide, and when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.poster.avif?t=1766849971\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.webm?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.mp4?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight offers a fragile peace, giving you time to prepare. But when night falls, the air thickens and the hunt begins. Creatures emerge from the shadows, and survival becomes a fight against both the unknown and the horrors of the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.poster.avif?t=1766849971\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.webm?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.mp4?t=1766849971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["FuristicStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co